  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's drug shortage list does not include alprazolam as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 157 tablets of the 0.5 mg presentation at 6.2 tablets per day, providing 25.2 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 155 tablets at 7.8 tablets per day, providing 19.8 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale Lakeside holds 44 tablets at 1.6 tablets per day, providing 26.9 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Amneal Pharmaceuticals LLC, which is not on FDA's shortage list today and operates the Amneal Pharmaceuticals of NY plant.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    },
    {
      "text": "An alternate manufacturer option is Par Health USA, LLC, also not on FDA's shortage list today, with the PH HEALTH plant.",
      "cites": ["D6"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Aurobindo Pharma Limited, a registered plant for alprazolam, received an OAI classification on 2019-12-26 after an inspection ending 2019-09-27, and a VAI classification on 2022-08-04 after an inspection ending 2022-05-10.",
      "cites": ["E5", "E6"]
